    \field{abstract}{%
    We report the implementation of a single-pass tilt-locking stabilization
  scheme in an opto-electronic oscillator using a high-finesse Fabry-Perot as
  photonic filter. A table-top setup leads to a phase noise level of −80
  dBc/Hz at 1 kHz offset from a 6 GHz carrier and a Allan deviation measurement
  of 3×10−10 for 1 s integration time. Future improvements leading to a
  compact fiber-free OEO are discussed.%
    }
    \verb{doi}
    \verb 10.1109/LPT.2025.3544428
    \endverb
